Christian Storyline:

Sarah Masih, 18

THIRD ROOM

You wake up in a tiny room. Out of the window you can see the first rays of the dawning sun creeping over the rim of the horizon, peeping between the irregularly built houses of your colony, touching the rooftops with orange fingers, and swiftly melding into golden yellow. In the room, your two sisters are still sleeping, and you have learnt over the past year how to get ready so as not to disturb them. 

You wash your face, brush your hair quickly, don your white uniform, and pick up your books.

It is a new day in a new ward, and you are excited for the classes and the chance to learn. Of course the matron in this ward is supposed to be pretty strict, but you are, on the whole, hardworking and brilliant, not to mention determined to get past tough exteriors to impress the hearts within. 

FOURTH ROOM

On the way out, you quickly look into see your paralyzed father, check his sores, and give him a turn in the bed and a quick kiss before leaving. Your mother, tired from working at the factory all day and well into the night, is sleeping peacefully. 

Rashid, your cousin, is waiting outside on his bike, right on time as usual. Your heart leaps as you see him, and you skip down the rough steps, pulling the door closed behind you. 

(Some choice about flirting? I don’t know) 

Sitting sidesaddle, clutching onto Rashid, the wind from the rushing cycle always makes you feel like a bird in flight. It is a new and beautiful day.

FIFTH ROOM

The Matron has already shown you how to place a line, and when you perfectly place the line in an old man's crinkly hand, even her stern face cracks into a smile. She tells you to properly dispose of the medical waste and briskly walks off.

The patient is a decrepit old man, who was lying peacefully and quietly while the matron was there. As soon as she rounds the bend, however, he reaches out to grab your hand.

You a) shout too surprised to react.

He grins at you with a leer, and reaches out with his other hand and quickly gives your breast a squeeze. Horrified you pull back and run off. As you look back, you see his hands beneath his sheet, obviously masturbating. 

There is no one in this part of the ward that has witnessed this act. You can A) complain and be disbelieved, get yelled at etc. or ignore the incident and go on. 

SIXTH ROOM

You go home that night to find out Rashid has been arrested by local police. He had gotten into a fight with his foreman at the factory and the man had accused him of blasphemy. Your heart sinks. Conditions are bad already and you go to sleep scared and worried. 

SEVENTH ROOM

You wake up in the (same?) night to the sounds of screams and the smell of fire and smoke. There is a fire somewhere nearby. Your sisters wake up and are screaming, your parents are outside and there is noise and darkness and orange stifling smoke everywhere. You realise that the fire has caught from the lower floors and there is no way out but the window. You quickly pass down your sisters from the window, making them jump into the arms of bystanders below, hoping your parents and your brothers got out safely. 

You turn back to get your books, not wanting to leave them to be burnt, when the smoke overcomes you and the world turns black. You faint and know no more.